WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.091 --> 00:00:16.432
and Mandy quickly followed Varius through the city.

2
00:00:17.612 --> 00:00:20.573
The children were looking at everything around them.

3
00:00:20.593 --> 00:00:24.634
"You are not familiar with our city," Varius said.

4
00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:27.535
The children looked at each other.

5
00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:31.316
"We are new here," Mandy said.

6
00:00:32.336 --> 00:00:33.317
Varius nodded.

7
00:00:33.337 --> 00:00:34.758
"I understand.

8
00:00:35.439 --> 00:00:37.400
You will get to know the city very soon."

9
00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:42.704
They passed a few buildings as they walked down a narrow street.

10
00:00:42.724 --> 00:00:47.148
"This is where all the doctors live," Varius explained.

11
00:00:47.168 --> 00:00:50.030
"All the doctors live together?"

12
00:00:50.731 --> 00:00:51.431
asked Vinnie.

13
00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:57.156
"No, they have their own homes," Varius laughed.

14
00:00:57.176 --> 00:00:59.558
"But the city is divided up.

15
00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:02.060
The doctors all live in one area.

16
00:01:02.932 --> 00:01:04.273
The butchers live in another.

17
00:01:05.213 --> 00:01:06.594
It's easier to find people."

18
00:01:08.094 --> 00:01:11.736
A few minutes later, they arrived in the butchers' area.

19
00:01:12.676 --> 00:01:15.838
People lived in apartments on top of their shops.

20
00:01:16.998 --> 00:01:20.039
Children were outside playing some kind of game.

21
00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:23.261
They had drawn squares in the dirt.

22
00:01:24.081 --> 00:01:26.402
Each square had a rock or a shell.

23
00:01:26.422 --> 00:01:29.723
"It looks like tic-tac-toe!"

24
00:01:30.324 --> 00:01:31.024
said Vinnie.

25
00:01:32.072 --> 00:01:36.655
"Sorry to interrupt your game," said Varius, leaning over the children.

26
00:01:36.675 --> 00:01:39.677
"Do you know where Melus the stable boy lives?"

27
00:01:40.658 --> 00:01:41.599
"He is over there.

28
00:01:41.619 --> 00:01:44.841
His mother is sick," a girl said.

29
00:01:45.822 --> 00:01:47.163
She pointed to a house.

30
00:01:48.664 --> 00:01:52.586
Varius and the children walked over and knocked on the door.

31
00:01:53.747 --> 00:01:54.788
Melus answered.

32
00:01:54.808 --> 00:02:00.552
"We know about your mother, but your master Aquila is in danger," Varius said.

33
00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.321
He explained about Brutus.

34
00:02:03.341 --> 00:02:09.263
"My mother is feeling better, praise the gods," Melus said.

35
00:02:09.283 --> 00:02:13.765
"My father is with her now, so I can return to the stables.

36
00:02:14.866 --> 00:02:16.206
What should I do about Brutus?"

37
00:02:16.226 --> 00:02:24.710
"Don't let anyone near Aquila's horses," said Mandy, "or they will be poisoned."

38
00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:28.051
"I will guard my master's horses with my life!"

39
00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:29.532
Melus cried.

40
00:02:30.504 --> 00:02:31.824
He ran out the door.

41
00:02:32.765 --> 00:02:35.645
Varius and the children left Melus' house.

42
00:02:35.665 --> 00:02:38.626
"Do you trust Melus?"

43
00:02:39.246 --> 00:02:40.147
Mandy asked.

44
00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:42.507
"Yes, I do.

45
00:02:43.128 --> 00:02:45.568
Melus was chosen to look after Aquila's horses.

46
00:02:46.648 --> 00:02:50.009
That is a very special job," explained Varius.

47
00:02:50.029 --> 00:02:51.990
"Melus knows this.

48
00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.651
So he will not betray his master."

49
00:02:56.471 --> 00:02:57.792
"What should we do now?"

50
00:02:58.612 --> 00:02:59.292
asked Vinnie.

51
00:03:00.364 --> 00:03:03.727
"We must speak with Master Antonius," said Varius.

52
00:03:04.728 --> 00:03:07.770
"He is responsible for our festivals and public buildings.

53
00:03:08.871 --> 00:03:11.713
As Septimus said, he is in charge of today's race."

54
00:03:11.733 --> 00:03:14.776
"When does the race begin?"

55
00:03:15.597 --> 00:03:16.417
asked Mandy.

56
00:03:17.578 --> 00:03:19.440
Varius looked up at the sun.

57
00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:21.842
"It will begin soon.

58
00:03:22.082 --> 00:03:24.003
We must hurry," he said.

59
00:03:24.023 --> 00:03:29.448
Varius stopped in front of a large house with a stone fountain.

60
00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.868
"Master Antonius lives here," said Varius.

61
00:03:35.832 --> 00:03:39.199
A man with a hammer was bent close to the ground.
